' ============================================================================
' autofm - shared C4-PlantUML style (NEW_C4_STYLE)
' ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
' Each diagram sets !NEW_C4_STYLE=1 and includes the PUBLIC C4-PlantUML stdlib,
' then includes this file. New style owns element theming (clean modern
' defaults), so this file only sets shared layout prefs, person outlines, and
' the sync/async relationship tags used across the set. No private includes,
' no custom fonts - renders on any machine and on public GitHub CI.
' ============================================================================

' ---- layout ----
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65

' ---- people as outlines (C4 person figure) ----
SHOW_PERSON_OUTLINE()

' ---- shared relationship semantics -----------------------------------------
' async  : dashed line  (message bus, closed-loop API callbacks)
' sync   : solid line   (default; file / blocking calls) - provided for explicit
'          tagging where contrast with async is useful.
AddRelTag("async", $lineStyle=DashedLine())
AddRelTag("sync", $lineStyle=SolidLine())
